WEBVTT

00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:06.710
Fall, shooting stars. Burn, and burn out.

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:11.080
And...!

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:31.000
They made it in time?

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:34.050
<i>We gave them that time!</i>

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:39.040
<i>We, humanity, struggled against 
a god with our own power!</i>

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:43.260
You're Carol and Elfnein-chan, right?

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:46.710
Yeah. But we can talk later.

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:48.290
Miku!

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:51.850
Cursed fist. God-killer.

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.240
What will you do in the face 
of my vessel, your friend?

00:00:56.530 --> 00:01:00.790
So, what if I was causing 
trouble for someone else?

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:07.080
If somebody's causing trouble for 
somebody else, I'll stop them...

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:06.420
<b>Episode 13
Let's Make History With A Light That Even the Gods Don't Know</b>

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:08.430
with my fists!

00:01:08.430 --> 00:01:12.920
With the seven of us together, 
we can overturn the will of the gods!

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:14.180
Let's go together!

00:01:17.870 --> 00:01:20.760
<i>Why did the sky drip with songs?</i>

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:23.840
<i>Why did humanity create words?</i>

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:30.600
<i>It was because their lonely hearts 
wanted to understand each other.</i>

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:33.030
So you've come together to 
increase your powers...

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:36.870
<i>When you're alone, a melody 
has no meaning, just tears</i>

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:36.870
Impossible...

00:01:36.870 --> 00:01:39.870
We're not being nullified 
by her impossible power?

00:01:36.870 --> 00:01:40.130
<i>What is love? What are dreams?</i>

00:01:40.130 --> 00:01:45.940
<i>Don't mess with humanity, 
because it's struggled and survived!</i>

00:01:45.940 --> 00:01:52.320
<i>The seven musical scales gather 
and assume their true form</i>

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:55.570
<i>The birthing cry of the stars explodes</i>

00:01:55.570 --> 00:02:02.060
<i>Can you hear it? This heartbeat</i>

00:01:57.020 --> 00:01:58.880
With the light of the Shenshoujin...

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:03.710
If we've got a god-killer, 
then she's a Symphogear-killer.

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:05.470
<i>Can you hear it? This hope</i>

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:10.330
<i>Let our last song burn and shine</i>

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:17.800
<i>This world will it connect. 
The power to love you is there.</i>

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:15.440
It's really working!

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:17.900
With the power of the Ex-Drive, maybe...

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:23.970
<i>Even if we lose hundreds, thousands, or tens 
of thousands of times, we won't give up on life</i>

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:23.280
No, but it's like we're cutting 
through her barrier...

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:30.540
<i>This world will take flight 
turning its songs into wings</i>

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:30.540
Energy is at max!

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:32.540
Area threat level increasing!

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:33.530
<i>Give it your all, everything you've got</i>

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:35.280
A mythology-class special 
disaster is being created!

00:02:33.530 --> 00:02:36.780
<i>Full power, hand in hand together</i>

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:42.650
<i>Believe in justice and let courage bloom</i>

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:42.090
Shem-ha is using Miku's body as a vessel...

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:44.560
But now she's getting serious!

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:49.480
<i>A bridge to tomorrow, save the future</i>

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:50.970
It's Shem-ha's final form!

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:53.950
She's a real Deus ex Machina!

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:58.080
What I wanted wasn't the power.

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:00.310
It was the future that lies beyond it.

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:04.970
<i>I want to share all the feelings I have</i>

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:08.160
<i>With all the words I can muster</i>

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:12.890
<i>Humanity's power is to struggle</i>

00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:14.860
<i>Noble possibilities</i>

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:17.540
<i>Supporting each other when we lack something</i>

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:20.620
Even for us, as long as we are individuals,

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:21.050
<i>Tears and smiles together</i>

00:03:20.620 --> 00:03:23.010
we will become deluded and 
clash with one another.

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:24.230
<i>It's okay to be weak, you can become strong,</i>

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:30.370
<i>If you're a person who's clung to life</i>

00:03:27.650 --> 00:03:31.180
Anything like that called a "perfect being."

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:33.660
<i>Seven harmonies gathered here</i>

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:33.650
Gods are such absurd things.

00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:39.940
<i>Become light, tear your way to the limit</i>

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:42.930
<i>And scream</i>

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:48.420
And thus, in this laboratory,
 I dreamed of uniting all individuals.

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:46.080
<i>Can you hear this harmony?</i>

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:49.160
<i>Can you hear this symphony?</i>

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:54.410
<i>Strike and howl, this is our last song</i>

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:54.910
Everyone!

00:03:57.210 --> 00:04:00.400
<i>There is meaning in this life</i>

00:03:58.160 --> 00:04:04.090
For a future where no one has to hurt or cry 
because they cannot understand each other.

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:03.580
<i>It has the power to keep you alive</i>

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:09.750
<i>Share all the words you have 
until your soul and voice are dry</i>

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:05.580
Miku!

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:09.400
I'll see you later.

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:13.020
Yeah, you take care, too, Hibiki.

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:16.180
<i>Our lives burn so bright 
to melt a frozen heart</i>

00:04:14.570 --> 00:04:17.050
This time I want to put 
my feelings into words!

00:04:16.180 --> 00:04:19.380
<i>Give it your all, bonds, hearts as one</i>

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:21.560
Incomplete words that cannot even 
allow you to understand one another?

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:22.710
<i>Full power, they're telling you to rise up</i>

00:04:22.020 --> 00:04:26.350
It's because she had feelings for you 
that she couldn't put into those words,

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:30.320
that this vessel accepted 
me even for an instant.

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:34.910
<i>And protect the future with our hands!</i>

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:31.470
Miku did that?

00:04:55.430 --> 00:04:56.800
Now's our chance!

00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:58.850
Over Brave!

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:09.860
<i>This world will take flight 
turning its songs into wings</i>

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:13.190
<i>Give it your all, everything you've got</i>

00:05:13.190 --> 00:05:16.240
<i>Full power, hand in hand together</i>

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:21.920
<i>Believe in justice and let courage bloom</i>

00:05:22.390 --> 00:05:27.670
<i>A bridge to tomorrow, save the future</i>

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:30.080
Will you kill me with your cursed fist?

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:45.600
Your struggles are pathetic!

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:50.080
But at least when you die, 
you will shine in silver!

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:09.550
Carol-chan's Golden Transmutation?

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:12.260
Using applied alchemy?

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:16.350
But to match this kind of power...

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:21.850
Yes! We have to burn both our memories!

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:24.520
Are they both...

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:26.910
Carol-chan! Elfnein-chan!

00:06:26.910 --> 00:06:28.640
Hibiki Tachibana!

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:31.470
What will you do? What do you wish for?

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:32.990
Me?

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:34.030
Yes.

00:06:35.210 --> 00:06:38.540
I... I want to take Miku for myself!

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:42.790
Not to help other people! 
But because I want it!

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:47.320
Then continue reaching out your hand, 
like you once did for me!

00:06:47.320 --> 00:06:52.050
But the hand I reach out to others is 
cursed. It has the power to kill.

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:55.320
That which curses it as a 
curse is itself a curse.

00:06:55.320 --> 00:06:58.820
What's in your hands are the feelings 
of a person you've never met!

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:04.630
Feelings?

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:13.870
Carol-chan!

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:19.260
Infuriating. But it seems 
she's burnt herself out.

00:07:19.260 --> 00:07:20.790
Is this the end?

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:23.140
No, this is the beginning!

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:34.440
I'm seeing a planetary-scale 
crust fluctuation!

00:07:34.440 --> 00:07:35.680
No, this is...

00:07:38.380 --> 00:07:43.970
The Earth's orbital speed is increasing due to 
the propulsion from Yggdrasil's core!

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:49.700
Now return to how you should be, 
how you were 5,000 years ago.

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:21.860
I've counted the connection barriers 
induced by solar radiation.

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:26.040
Now the bio-terminal network 
will be constructed.

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:30.240
I will unite all the power and 
life I hid within all humanity,

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:34.380
and violate it, as the one 
and omnipresent Shem-ha.

00:08:36.690 --> 00:08:38.200
God-killer?

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:41.460
Your power allowed you escape the connection?

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:44.700
I'm taking back Miku!

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:45.870
You will fail!

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:49.090
Your fist is filled with curses, God-Killer!

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:51.590
Strike, and you will kill her
 and destroy this body!

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:53.260
I won't!

00:08:53.890 --> 00:08:58.270
Dad taught me that curses and blessings 
are two sides of the same coin!

00:08:58.270 --> 00:09:00.690
One can become the other!

00:09:00.690 --> 00:09:02.510
I can change it!

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:05.760
I have all the fragments within this body!

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:08.890
I'm not giving it to anybody!

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:11.730
But even if that's true...

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:16.380
My emotions! My feelings for Miku!

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:20.040
Who says they're worth less 
than 2,000 years of curses?!

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:28.020
Get it back...

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:29.040
Get it back...

00:09:29.580 --> 00:09:31.000
The future...

00:09:31.280 --> 00:09:32.720
Our...

00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:34.470
Tomorrow...

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:36.700
Our tomorrow...

00:09:36.960 --> 00:09:38.850
Network disruptions?

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:39.800
In that case...

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:42.370
We'll get it back...

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:44.830
It's something very important...

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:47.150
Our instincts are seeking 
it and screaming...

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:49.520
So that everyone can have it equally...

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:52.010
Bring it together in your hands, Tachibana!

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:55.830
The value of humanity that your 
father showed you... and its light!

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:00.770
With the Curse of Balal gone,

00:10:00.770 --> 00:10:04.470
it's not just gods who can 
bring people together!

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:08.290
She's bringing people's emotions together!

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:10.610
This isn't the god-killer!

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:14.530
This hand that pierces is my Armed Gear!

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:21.340
The future!

00:10:21.540 --> 00:10:22.800
Miku!

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:27.940
To get them back!

00:10:25.820 --> 00:10:28.600
Did she really overcome the curse?!

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:54.880
And... with blooming courage...

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:59.990
To never let what I love go again...

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:27.230
<i>So this is what I get for using 
the song that ends the world</i>

00:11:27.230 --> 00:11:29.940
<i>in a way it was not intended.</i>

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:31.820
But...

00:11:32.510 --> 00:11:33.720
Why?

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:39.920
We swore that we'd burn both of our 
memories to reclaim tomorrow!

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:41.320
So why?

00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:44.550
It's pathetic.

00:11:44.820 --> 00:11:49.130
I was so incredibly scared of 
vanishing from your memories...

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:53.230
Is that why you didn't burn my memories,

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:56.320
and instead burned everything you had?

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:03.530
I... We... will never forget!

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:05.210
Tomorrow, the day after,

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:09.650
we'll live on in the world you protected,
 and never forget you!

00:12:13.150 --> 00:12:16.160
This is goodbye, other me.

00:12:17.450 --> 00:12:21.120
Until we meet again, other me.

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:33.480
Carol...

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:38.850
The speed of the planet's environment 
modification is returning to normal.

00:12:38.850 --> 00:12:40.750
Report!

00:12:42.460 --> 00:12:44.780
Visual confirmation.

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:48.630
HQ, Shem-ha has fallen, 
but Yggdrasil is still alive!

00:12:48.630 --> 00:12:49.550
<i>What?</i>

00:12:52.570 --> 00:12:55.080
It's processing using calculation devices
 all over the world!

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:58.530
We estimate seven minutes until 
the logic walls are breached!

00:12:59.260 --> 00:13:02.260
Head down to the bottom of 
Yggdrasil's main shaft.

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:06.750
<i>Destroy its core and stop the 
planet's environment from changing!</i>

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:08.110
Yggdrasil...

00:13:08.820 --> 00:13:10.890
Let's go. It'll work out.

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:12.090
Chris-chan?

00:13:12.090 --> 00:13:17.590
If we shut down Yggdrasil's core,
 it should shut down all over the world.

00:13:17.590 --> 00:13:18.570
Let's go!

00:13:22.430 --> 00:13:23.700
We're counting on you...

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:30.460
The Wielders are heading to Earth's core.

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:32.470
Distance 9,800.

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:34.360
Over 10,000.

00:13:35.520 --> 00:13:36.960
Enemy signals?

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:44.170
Look at 'em all...

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:46.190
But in our current condition...

00:13:46.190 --> 00:13:48.500
If we don't hurry, Earth will...

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:51.340
...become a new planet!

00:13:51.630 --> 00:14:00.140
<i>Rei Shénshòujìn rei zizzl.</i>

00:14:14.190 --> 00:14:15.120
Miku?

00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:19.460
I don't want to be stuck behind you anymore!

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:23.310
I want to see what you see, by your side!

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:23.970
So...

00:14:24.260 --> 00:14:25.670
<i>I made it in time!</i>

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:27.510
You're okay, Elfnein?

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:30.600
Yes. Miku-san and I are fine.

00:14:30.600 --> 00:14:31.800
<i>What about Carol-chan?</i>

00:14:33.400 --> 00:14:36.440
Carol had a message for you.

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:42.340
<i>Even if you destroy the core, 
one of the other Yggdrasils</i>

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:46.320
<i>will gain the ability to finish 
the process, and you will fail.</i>

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:51.520
So there'll be a new main shaft, 
and we won't know which is it is?

00:14:51.520 --> 00:14:55.020
So, since we know that 
you're in the main shaft,

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:57.490
we have to take control of 
the core with phonic gain,

00:14:57.490 --> 00:15:00.860
and prune the others by blowing them up!

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:02.510
Phonic gain?

00:15:02.510 --> 00:15:07.220
But we failed with the 
Château de Tiffauges.

00:15:07.220 --> 00:15:10.560
That's why Carol was trying to save Miku!

00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:13.600
Seven planets and seven musical scales.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:17.050
The wave motion of the sound that harmonizes 
with the world is the unified language.

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:21.100
With your seven songs, you can 
alter the will of the gods.

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:26.400
This is Carol's own answer to her father's 
demand, that she know the world.

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:28.660
Seven harmonies...

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:33.150
With the seven of us together, 
we can overturn the will of the gods!

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:37.260
That's why we and Carol, 
the seven of us working together,

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:41.330
were able to break through 
Shem-ha's impossible physics?

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:55.500
Then there's no need to hesitate!

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:57.440
Let's trust the song in our hearts!

00:15:57.440 --> 00:16:00.510
I'll sing with you, Hibiki! With all of you!

00:16:05.320 --> 00:16:09.470
<i>When you put your hand to 
your heart, what you remember</i>

00:16:09.470 --> 00:16:13.450
<i>Isn't pain or tears</i>

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:17.330
<i>It's the hands you held, 
the fact you're not alone</i>

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:21.450
<i>The days when you understood 
each other, right?</i>

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:25.380
<i>It's that from the day of the beginning 
to today, the day of the end,</i>

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:23.550
<i>The Curse of Balal...</i>

00:16:23.550 --> 00:16:26.210
<i>I thought that without the 
curse that keeps us apart...</i>

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:29.540
<i>there was meaning in this story</i>

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:30.220
<i>I could tell her everything 
about how I felt.</i>

00:16:29.540 --> 00:16:33.440
<i>You can hold your head high 
and say you saw it to the end</i>

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:33.400
<i>But that's not enough...</i>

00:16:33.440 --> 00:16:38.450
<i>I'm glad I met you all</i>

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:39.960
Seven harmonies...

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:47.390
<i>There's nothing to be afraid 
of, the sun will always rise</i>

00:16:40.420 --> 00:16:46.970
Did Ryoko-san, in her pursuit of the unified 
language, create seven Symphogears?

00:16:46.970 --> 00:16:51.790
Ryoko-san's words were stolen from 
her before she could say the truth.

00:16:47.390 --> 00:16:51.420
<i>The pain and fun of living</i>

00:16:51.420 --> 00:16:56.870
<i>It all becomes a miracle</i>

00:16:51.790 --> 00:16:54.620
She did everything she could 
to overcome that barrier.

00:16:56.870 --> 00:17:08.370
<i>Thank you and goodbye, I'm glad I 
was born in this ephemeral world</i>

00:17:03.420 --> 00:17:07.430
And what that created was
 the Noise, the songs,

00:17:07.430 --> 00:17:09.350
and all the heretical technologies.

00:17:08.370 --> 00:17:12.940
<i>And I met and connected with you all</i>

00:17:09.350 --> 00:17:12.390
Her desire to simply be connected with others,

00:17:12.390 --> 00:17:17.250
after all this time, has become a 
miracle that connects all humanity.

00:17:12.940 --> 00:17:21.520
<i>Thank you and goodbye, 
look back and the stars are falling</i>

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:20.380
It is an escape from the Anunnaki's bonds.

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:22.380
Humanity's independence.

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:25.600
<i>They've flown into a sky of courage</i>

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:33.280
<i>As if to take the place of the tears we'd shed</i>

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:42.920
<i>Yes, like beautiful fireworks of goodbye.</i>

00:17:44.610 --> 00:17:46.560
<i>Our seven songs...</i>

00:17:46.560 --> 00:17:48.210
<i>Everyone's songs...</i>

00:17:48.530 --> 00:17:51.680
This miracle belongs to all of us!

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:54.060
A story told by hands held in hands...

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:56.890
A strong, noble, and ephemeral thing...

00:17:56.890 --> 00:17:59.530
Let it resound throughout the future!

00:18:00.190 --> 00:18:06.400
<i>Gatrandis babel ziggurat edenal</i>

00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:12.030
<i>Emustolronzen fine el baral zizzl</i>

00:18:12.030 --> 00:18:17.860
<i>Gatrandis babel ziggurat edenal</i>

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:28.360
<i>Emustolronzen fine el zizzl</i>

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:37.840
This is our...

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:43.680
...Climax Song!

00:18:51.530 --> 00:18:54.430
High-energy signals are
 emanating from the core!

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:57.270
Yggdrasil is collapsing!

00:18:57.270 --> 00:18:59.480
It's happening all over the world!

00:19:02.400 --> 00:19:03.510
But...

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:09.130
At this rate, our Gears...

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:10.710
...won't last!

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:14.550
Is that...

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:15.800
Shem-ha?!

00:19:26.480 --> 00:19:27.610
Everyone!

00:19:32.510 --> 00:19:37.020
Answer me. Why do you 
refuse to meld into one?

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:40.350
It's because we can't 
understand each other easily

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:44.070
that we can care for others 
and come to love them.

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:47.040
I don't want anyone to 
destroy those feelings!

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:53.030
Even if that causes you to hurt 
and suffer in the future?

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:55.020
But even if that's true,

00:19:55.020 --> 00:19:58.830
even when we're hurt, 
we can walk on our two feet.

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:02.700
We can make history with a light 
that even the gods don't know!

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:06.970
Then fulfill your duty,

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:11.050
because you now control the future.

00:20:17.290 --> 00:20:18.450
Is that...

00:20:37.740 --> 00:20:39.690
Are you okay, Hibiki-kun?

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:41.300
Master...

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:46.810
Shem-ha-san... Held us in 
her huge hands... and...

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:51.670
Yes. This is the world of tomorrow 
that you all protected!

00:22:28.030 --> 00:22:31.990
<b>Grave of the Kazanari Clan</b>

00:22:47.870 --> 00:22:52.070
"Eight thousand and eight times the cuckoo 
cries, spitting up blood each time."

00:22:52.070 --> 00:22:54.100
As long as humans are humans,

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:57.300
it will be difficult to connect 
without hurting each other.

00:22:58.050 --> 00:23:02.230
But the blood shed from the frustration 
of not being able to connect,

00:23:02.230 --> 00:23:05.380
has created so many wonderful lights.

00:23:12.990 --> 00:23:14.740
Um, Hibiki...

00:23:15.070 --> 00:23:19.590
There was something 
I've always wanted to tell you.

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:23.040
Yeah, me too.

00:23:25.670 --> 00:23:30.720
I hope what I want to tell you is
 the same thing you want to tell me.

00:23:35.220 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>Senki Zessho Symphogear</b>

00:23:35.220 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>Fin</b>
